## US-Bangla Airlines (usbair.com) — Information Extraction Audit

**Method:** static cURL of `https://usbair.com/` (SSR HTML + `__NEXT_DATA__`), Next.js client chunks, `https://alphaapi.usbair.com` API (`/api/common-json-view?tag=popup-advertisement`), and pixel inspection of the popup JPG, loyalty SVG (rendered via rsvg-convert), and vacation banner PNG. No browser automation used.

### 1. Flight Booking Engine UI
- **(a) Default origin airport in 'From' field:** **Not Found (no airport pre-selected).** The context state `fromSelectedAddress` is initialized to `null` with no mount effect setting it, so the 'From' field renders empty, showing the placeholder label **"Departure"** (at 30% text opacity). No default airport code or name.
- **(b) Search CTA button:** Text = **"Search Flights"**. Styling: red background `#C30B12`, white text (`text-white`), `rounded`, centered flex layout, `px-10 py-3 lg:px-8` padding, Roboto font, normal weight, with a **white airplane (plane) SVG icon** to the right of the label. It renders **disabled** inside a wrapper with `opacity-50` + `cursor-not-allowed` (greyed out) until From/To are filled.
- **(c) Default passenger count / cabin class:** **1 Passenger** and **Economy**.

### 2. Promotional Mastercard Popup Modal
(Served as a single image: `cdn.usbair.com/website/public/images/promotion/mastercard-offer-popup-web.jpg` / `-mobile.jpg`, fetched via `common-json-view?tag=popup-advertisement`.)
- **(a) Discounts & promo codes:** **Domestic: 15% OFF — code `USBA15`**; **International: 10% OFF — code `USBAIN10`**.
- **(b) Lucky-draw grand prize:** **"Couple Holiday in Kuala Lumpur!"** (a couple's holiday in Kuala Lumpur). The **three domestic return-ticket options: Cox's Bazar, Sylhet, Chattogram**.
- **(c) Validity expiry:** **"Till 31st October 2026"** (printed as "Validity: Till 31ST October 2026").
- **(d) Cardholder name on the black Mastercard:** **"SABRINA ISLAM"** (card face: 5123 4567 8901 2345, expiry 02/31).

### 3. Sky Star Loyalty Program
- **(a) Four tier star badges (circular icons):** **Silver, Gold, Platinum, Titanium** (confirmed in the homepage `Join-Sky-Star-02.svg` and the membership-tiers page headings "Sky Star Silver / Gold / Platinum / Titanium").
- **(b) Primary CTA headline for the loyalty club:** **"Join Sky Star"** (heading), with the CTA button labeled **"Join now"**.

### 4. Vacation Promotion & Marketing
- **(a) Headline (overwater-resort banner):** **"Enjoy your favorite holiday destination and Earn Miles!"**
- **(b) Button text on the banner:** **"Make Memories"**

### 5. Destination from Dhaka Section
- **(a) Default city pre-filled in the "Destination from…" auto-complete:** **Dhaka** (the `LZ` geo context defaults location to `BD` → maps to city "Dhaka", which auto-fills the `#auto_com` input on the homepage).
- **(b) Kolkata moniker:** **"City of Joy"** ("Book Your Flight to the City of Joy").
- **(c) Guangzhou moniker:** **"City of Flowers"** ("Book Your Flight to the City of Flowers").
- **(d) Kuala Lumpur descriptor:** **"cosmopolitan metropolis"** ("Book Your Flight to the cosmopolitan metropolis").

### 6. Footer Affordances & App Promotion
- **(a) Newsletter field:** placeholder = **"Email Address"**; action button label = **"Subscribe"**. (Section heading: "Subscribe to our special offers".)
- **(b) App value proposition:** **"Book and manage your flight & Get exclusive discounts"** (verbatim, note the double space after "and" in source).
- **(c) Copyright line (verbatim, bottom of page):** **"© 2026 US-Bangla Airlines. All rights reserved."**

---
**Notes / caveats:** Items 1(a) and the static `value=""` of the `#auto_com` box are empty in the raw SSR HTML; the "Dhaka" default in 5(a) is a deterministic client-side default (BD→Dhaka) that appears after hydration. The Mastercard modal, its promo codes, dates, and the embossed cardholder name are rendered inside the promotion image (not HTML/JS), so they were extracted by image inspection of both desktop and mobile versions (which agree).
